    text m_tomorrow_en "tomorrow" #8f887c x 830 y 580 font_size 32 hidden true
    group markers members ["m_today","m_tomorrow","m_today_en","m_tomorrow_en"] hidden true

    card title "The week"

A: What are the days of the week in Russian, and how do you say what day it is today?
    draw en_col

B: Понеде́льник, вто́рник, среда́, четве́рг, пя́тница, суббо́та, воскресе́нье.
    draw d_mon d_tue d_wed d_thu d_fri d_sat d_sun

A: They're written small, with no capitals, and each one hides a meaning.
    highlight strip color #8f887c effect underline

    draw n_mon

A: Inside понеде́льник is неде́ля, from lesson two: long ago it meant Sunday, so Monday is the day after it.
    highlight d_mon color #c9871a part недел

    draw n_tue

B: Вто́рник comes from второ́й, second.
    highlight d_tue color #c9871a part ^втор

    draw n_wed

B: Среда́ comes from an old word for middle.
    highlight d_wed color #c9871a

    draw n_thu

A: Четве́рг starts like четы́ре, four, from lesson six: Thursday is day four.
    highlight d_thu color #c9871a part ^четв

    draw n_fri

B: And пя́тница has пять, five: so the days count from Monday.
    highlight d_fri color #c9871a part ^пят

    draw n_sat

A: The weekend has no numbers: суббо́та comes from the same old word as Sabbath.
    highlight d_sat color #c9871a

    draw n_sun

B: And воскресе́нье means resurrection.
    highlight d_sun color #c9871a

    erase notes

    draw t_mon t_tue parallel true

A: Now lesson two: понеде́льник and вто́рник end in a consonant, к, so they're он.
    highlight d_mon d_tue color #2f6b8f part к$

    draw t_thu

B: So does четве́рг, with г.
    highlight d_thu color #2f6b8f part г$

    draw t_wed t_fri t_sat parallel true

A: Среда́, пя́тница and суббо́та end in а, so they're она́.
    highlight d_wed d_fri d_sat color #b5482e part а$

    draw t_sun

B: And воскресе́нье ends in е, like мо́ре, so Sunday is оно́.
    highlight d_sun color #8a5fa8 part е$

    erase tags

A: Two new words put the week to work: сего́дня, today, where the г says v, and за́втра, tomorrow.
    draw m_today m_today_en m_tomorrow m_tomorrow_en

    erase m_today_en m_tomorrow_en

    glossed g1 "Сего́дня понеде́льник. За́втра вто́рник." say_voice b gloss ["today","Monday","tomorrow","Tuesday"] show_gloss under x 500 y 105 width 980 font_size 48

B: Сего́дня понеде́льник.
    highlight g1_w_1 g1_w_2 d_mon color #c9871a

B: За́втра вто́рник.
    highlight g1_w_3 g1_w_4 d_tue color #c9871a

A: As always, there's no word for is. And when the week moves on, the two words move with it.
    move m_today m_tomorrow by [0,-272] duration 2

    erase g1

    glossed g2 "Сего́дня пя́тница? Да! За́втра суббо́та!" say_voice b gloss ["today","Friday","yes","tomorrow","Saturday"] show_gloss under x 500 y 105 width 980 font_size 48

A: Сего́дня пя́тница?
    highlight g2_w_1 g2_w_2 d_fri color #c9871a

B: Да! За́втра суббо́та!
    highlight g2_w_3 g2_w_4 g2_w_5 d_sat color #c9871a

    erase g2

    hide strip en_col m_today m_tomorrow

    cards match size 1.6 y 440
        * "сего́дня" match today
        * "за́втра" match tomorrow
        * "среда́" match Wednesday
        * "четве́рг" match Thursday

    ask "Match each Russian word to its English meaning." on match store m stage own voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, from memory, then your score.
        right: Сего́дня, today; за́втра, tomorrow; среда́, Wednesday; четве́рг, Thursday.
        wrong: You got {m} on the first try.

    erase match

    quiz "Which day has five inside its name? Pick one." store q2 reveal.text "пя́тница · пять · 5" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Friday: пять, five, is right at the start.
        wrong: Look for пять at the start of a name.
        + пя́тница
        * понеде́льник
        * суббо́та

    erase q2_stamp

    ask "Сего́дня понеде́льник. What is за́втра? Type the day." answer ["вторник"] store q3 default вторник reveal.text "За́втра вто́рник." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Вто́рник, Tuesday: the second day, from второ́й.
        wrong: Tomorrow is day two: think of второ́й, second.

    erase q3_stamp

    quiz "Суббо́та: он, она́ or оно́? Pick one." store q4 reveal.text "суббо́та: она́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 80 reveal.color #b5482e voice b test t1
        right: Она́: суббо́та ends in а, like ма́ма.
        wrong: Look at its very last letter.
        * он
        + она́
        * оно́

    erase q4_stamp

    quiz "Сего́дня суббо́та. What is за́втра? Pick one." store q5 reveal.text "За́втра воскресе́нье." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 400 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Sunday: after суббо́та comes воскресе́нье, the last day of the week.
        wrong: Saturday, then the last day of the week.
        + воскресе́нье
        * понеде́льник
        * пя́тница

    erase q5_stamp

    show strip en_col m_today m_tomorrow

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

B: So the week counts from Monday, its names carry two, four and five, and their ends say he, she or it. Сего́дня: the week. За́втра: numbers to a hundred. Пока́!
    highlight d_tue d_thu d_fri color #c9871a

